  { "id": "polar-to-example", "front": "(HL) Write $1 + \\sqrt3\\,i$ in Euler form.", "back": "$r = 2$, $\\theta = \\frac\\pi3$ (first quadrant): $2e^{i\\pi/3}$.", "concept": "Converting forms", "kind": "application" },
